{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412110","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412110","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1041211001:1":{"text":"It's rare for the three of us to get together!","source_cn":"说起来，我们三个真是难得聚在一起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF75E83222F3C0E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041211002:1":{"text":"It's been a while; I've been traveling, and Parisa and you are both busy with your own things.","source_cn":"嗯，我一直在外游历，你和帕瑞莎也都忙于各自的事务，难得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15078EE42D3FE84B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041211003:1":{"text":"Back in school, Florabelle used to come out often to chat with us.","source_cn":"还记得上学的时候，芙拉贝尔总会时不时冒出来，和我们一起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC46177DD2E280CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041211004:1":{"text":"I heard she stayed at the academy after graduation and became a teacher. I wonder if she still enjoys teasing others...","source_cn":"听说她毕业后就留在学院当老师了？也不知道她有没有改掉调...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F3B1FC7959C97E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041211005:1":{"text":"Don't remind me! I still remember the things she said to me...","source_cn"